        <li><a href="https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/kostal-launches-25-kw-battery-inverter/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kostal launches 25 kW battery inverter — PV Magazine</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/china-topcon-cell-prices-jump-on-firmer-upstream-sentiment-and-rising-export-demand/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">China TOPCon cell prices jump on firmer upstream sentiment and rising export demand — PV Magazine</a></li>
